From eb7f671245a01edef0cca60a3300f73469fb3e6f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: keweiya <58689883+keweiya@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 11:09:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] feat(home): port HomeTweaks folder auto-close

Replace the older single-gate auto-close with the HomeTweaks 81
("folderautoclose") strategy: both early gates on the click path are NOP'ed so
a click inside an open folder runs the launcher's own close-then-launch block
with the stock animated close, and the grid re-scroll gate in the close routine
becomes an unconditional branch so closing does not start a second scroll.

The plan is decoded from the image and refuses on any ambiguity; three source
words are journaled through the existing apply/settle path, so turning the
switch off restores them byte for byte.
